## Day 39 — PDF Splitter & Merger
`day39-pdf-splitter-merger.html`

Premium browser-based PDF utility. Everything runs client-side (uses pdf-lib + pdf.js from CDN; no files are uploaded to any server).

- **Splitter:** auto page detection, visual page thumbnails, and five modes — custom page ranges (`1-3, 5, 8-10`), extract selected pages (click thumbnails), split every N pages, split after specific pages, one PDF per page. Live "Preview result" plan + range validation with invalid-input highlighting.
- **Merger:** multi-file drag-and-drop, per-file page counts + previews, drag-to-reorder, total files/pages summary, one-click merged download.
- Dark/light theme, loading overlay, toasts, keyboard shortcuts (`T` theme, `A` select-all, `Esc` clear).
